// The boss's combo, its first cut: 75 ticks, the default combo
// (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"): startup 0-25, active
// 25-30, recovery 30-75. The game plays it for the first cut, then
// combo_even for every even cut and combo_odd for every odd one after the
// first; only the last cut plays its recovery. Each part has keyframes at
// its ends. Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the
// model's axes; see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// 0: standing. 25: wound up, the halberd raised over the right shoulder in
// both hands. 26 to 30: one key a tick, a diagonal cut from the right
// shoulder down to the left (right to left, like the hit). 30 is the pose
// combo_even starts from. 40: following through. 58: coming back. 75:
// standing.
